{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tax-invoice-fc-2026",
    "name": "Tax Invoice Issuer - Full Coverage",
    "description": "Coleção completa de testes para Tax Invoice Issuer FC\n\n## Cenários Cobertos:\n- ✅ Happy Path (Cash & Accrual)\n- ✅ Validações de campos obrigatórios\n- ✅ Validações de tipos de dados\n- ✅ Validações de enums\n- ✅ Edge cases (limites, valores inválidos)\n- ✅ Health check\n- ✅ Testes de segurança e JSON malformado\n\n## Ambientes:\n- Azure Learn-prod: selecione o environment `Tax Invoice Issuer - Azure Learn-prod`\n- Local: selecione o environment `Tax Invoice Issuer - Local`\n\nA coleção usa a variável `baseUrl`, permitindo executar os mesmos requests contra o Azure ou contra uma instância local.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET / - Health Check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has hello world', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.hello).to.eql('world');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Verifica se o servidor está rodando corretamente"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Testes básicos de saúde da API"
    },
    {
      "name": "Happy Path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /invoice - Cash Basis Success",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response is an array', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Invoice has required fields', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('date');",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('amount');",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
